            connectedComponentIn ((pullback.fst (ModularCurve.TwoChart.modelTo A (↥K) j) s ⁻¹ᵁ U : (pullback (ModularCurve.TwoChart.modelTo A (↥K) j) s).Opens) : Set ↥(pullback (ModularCurve.TwoChart.modelTo A (↥K) j) s))
